<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo shr target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PepsiCo shr target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst George Thompson said he raised his share price target on PepsiCo to $40 from $38, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage retains its buy rating on the stock, the source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
